Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.78,0:00:09.67,Default_WMV_FHD_1920*1080_Microsoft YaHei,,0,0,0,,舔屁眼的女僕\N椎名空 泉莉音
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.88,0:00:17.06,Default_WMV_FHD_1920*1080_Microsoft YaHei,,0,0,0,,我們是舔屁眼的女僕
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.16,0:00:21.46,Default_WMV_FHD_1920*1080_Microsoft YaHei,,0,0,0,,我是舔屁眼女僕，空
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.66,0:00:26.59,Default_WMV_FHD_1920*1080_Microsoft YaHei,,0,0,0,,我是舔屁眼女僕，莉音
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.16,0:00:31.72,Default_WMV_FHD_1920*1080_Microsoft YaHei,,0,0,0,,我們兩個女僕
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.46,0:00:35.76,Default_WMV_FHD_1920*1080_Microsoft YaHei,,0,0,0,,会好好的，一起幫你們舔屁眼
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.22,0:00:40.16,Default_WMV_FHD_1920*1080_Microsoft YaHei,,0,0,0,,那邊好像有很美味的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.52,0:00:42.36,Default_WMV_FHD_1920*1080_Microsoft YaHei,,0,0,0,,要怎麼做
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.36,0:01:39.19,Default_WMV_FHD_1920*1080_Microsoft YaHei,,0,0,0,,喜歡被舔嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.29,0:01:53.49,Default_WMV_FHD_1920*1080_Microsoft YaHei,,0,0,0,,很美味
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.52,0:02:33.09,Default_WMV_FHD_1920*1080_Microsoft YaHei,,0,0,0,,一直在發抖
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.72,0:03:11.22,Default_WMV_FHD_1920*1080_Microsoft YaHei,,0,0,0,,主人，我們可以好好侍奉您嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.56,0:03:33.22,Default_WMV_FHD_1920*1080_Microsoft YaHei,,0,0,0,,很清爽的早晨呢\N睡的好嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.96,0:03:37.62,Default_WMV_FHD_1920*1080_Microsoft YaHei,,0,0,0,,失禮了\N失禮了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.86,0:03:47.89,Default_WMV_FHD_1920*1080_Microsoft YaHei,,0,0,0,,脫下來吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.49,0:04:09.89,Default_WMV_FHD_1920*1080_Microsoft YaHei,,0,0,0,,那麼，我們現在開始了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.99,0:04:14.66,Default_WMV_FHD_1920*1080_Microsoft YaHei,,0,0,0,,開始獎勵您了\N失禮了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.49,0:04:30.06,Default_WMV_FHD_1920*1080_Microsoft YaHei,,0,0,0,,健康狀況無異常
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.39,0:04:39.96,Default_WMV_FHD_1920*1080_Microsoft YaHei,,0,0,0,,無異常
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.26,0:05:29.46,Default_WMV_FHD_1920*1080_Microsoft YaHei,,0,0,0,,一會就會逐漸醒了的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.79,0:05:39.36,Default_WMV_FHD_1920*1080_Microsoft YaHei,,0,0,0,,舔一下這邊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.99,0:05:52.56,Default_WMV_FHD_1920*1080_Microsoft YaHei,,0,0,0,,前輩，是這樣嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.92,0:05:55.49,Default_WMV_FHD_1920*1080_Microsoft YaHei,,0,0,0,,舌頭再伸出來舔一下
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.49,0:06:10.16,Default_WMV_FHD_1920*1080_Microsoft YaHei,,0,0,0,,一開始，像這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.52,0:06:14.56,Default_WMV_FHD_1920*1080_Microsoft YaHei,,0,0,0,,慢慢的從內褲上面舔哦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.69,0:06:22.26,Default_WMV_FHD_1920*1080_Microsoft YaHei,,0,0,0,,前輩，我想快一點侍奉
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.62,0:06:24.82,Default_WMV_FHD_1920*1080_Microsoft YaHei,,0,0,0,,還只是早晨，不要著急
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.19,0:06:28.49,Default_WMV_FHD_1920*1080_Microsoft YaHei,,0,0,0,,慢慢侍奉他一下
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.52,0:06:57.09,Default_WMV_FHD_1920*1080_Microsoft YaHei,,0,0,0,,想我們快速的舔嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.06,0:07:07.72,Default_WMV_FHD_1920*1080_Microsoft YaHei,,0,0,0,,那麼，內褲脫下來了\N失禮了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.36,0:07:20.92,Default_WMV_FHD_1920*1080_Microsoft YaHei,,0,0,0,,今天的屁眼也好棒
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.99,0:07:31.56,Default_WMV_FHD_1920*1080_Microsoft YaHei,,0,0,0,,屁眼在發抖
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.59,0:07:39.99,Default_WMV_FHD_1920*1080_Microsoft YaHei,,0,0,0,,好棒，一直在發抖
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.19,0:07:44.39,Default_WMV_FHD_1920*1080_Microsoft YaHei,,0,0,0,,很癢嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.96,0:08:00.89,Default_WMV_FHD_1920*1080_Microsoft YaHei,,0,0,0,,首先 像這樣\N從周圍開始舔
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.32,0:08:26.19,Default_WMV_FHD_1920*1080_Microsoft YaHei,,0,0,0,,主人，像這樣被玩弄的話\N屁眼會動的很厲害
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.92,0:08:30.59,Default_WMV_FHD_1920*1080_Microsoft YaHei,,0,0,0,,是嗎?\N是吧?主人
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.82,0:08:51.49,Default_WMV_FHD_1920*1080_Microsoft YaHei,,0,0,0,,真的，一直在動
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.22,0:08:57.36,Default_WMV_FHD_1920*1080_Microsoft YaHei,,0,0,0,,好好舔一下\N好的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.46,0:09:12.39,Default_WMV_FHD_1920*1080_Microsoft YaHei,,0,0,0,,舔一下\N好的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.42,0:09:18.26,Default_WMV_FHD_1920*1080_Microsoft YaHei,,0,0,0,,失禮了
Comment: 0,0:09:21.06,0:09:25.33,Default_WMV_FHD_1920*1080_Microsoft YaHei,,0,0,0,,*******************************************
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.46,0:09:32.56,Default_WMV_FHD_1920*1080_Microsoft YaHei,,0,0,0,,像這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.66,0:09:36.96,Default_WMV_FHD_1920*1080_Microsoft YaHei,,0,0,0,,也一起摸蛋蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.69,0:09:40.62,Default_WMV_FHD_1920*1080_Microsoft YaHei,,0,0,0,,知道了嗎?\N是的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.72,0:10:16.92,Default_WMV_FHD_1920*1080_Microsoft YaHei,,0,0,0,,这邊也做看看
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.82,0:10:30.49,Default_WMV_FHD_1920*1080_Microsoft YaHei,,0,0,0,,很舒服嗎?主人
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.82,0:10:40.76,Default_WMV_FHD_1920*1080_Microsoft YaHei,,0,0,0,,我會幫你好好爽一下的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.09,0:11:02.39,Default_WMV_FHD_1920*1080_Microsoft YaHei,,0,0,0,,前輩的舌頭好淫蕩
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.76,0:11:04.96,Default_WMV_FHD_1920*1080_Microsoft YaHei,,0,0,0,,妳也要像這樣一起舔
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.56,0:11:25.12,Default_WMV_FHD_1920*1080_Microsoft YaHei,,0,0,0,,做的很好
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.82,0:11:35.02,Default_WMV_FHD_1920*1080_Microsoft YaHei,,0,0,0,,主人我們做的很厲害嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.99,0:11:44.92,Default_WMV_FHD_1920*1080_Microsoft YaHei,,0,0,0,,陰莖也很硬了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.26,0:12:05.82,Default_WMV_FHD_1920*1080_Microsoft YaHei,,0,0,0,,很硬了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.86,0:12:22.69,Default_WMV_FHD_1920*1080_Microsoft YaHei,,0,0,0,,好敏感啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.19,0:12:30.39,Default_WMV_FHD_1920*1080_Microsoft YaHei,,0,0,0,,好好摸一下\N好的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.52,0:12:37.36,Default_WMV_FHD_1920*1080_Microsoft YaHei,,0,0,0,,好棒，很硬了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.59,0:13:07.79,Default_WMV_FHD_1920*1080_Microsoft YaHei,,0,0,0,,蜜汁全流出來了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.36,0:13:14.39,Default_WMV_FHD_1920*1080_Microsoft YaHei,,0,0,0,,早上開始好淫蕩
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.46,0:13:25.02,Default_WMV_FHD_1920*1080_Microsoft YaHei,,0,0,0,,前輩，很硬了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.39,0:13:27.59,Default_WMV_FHD_1920*1080_Microsoft YaHei,,0,0,0,,就是那樣
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.52,0:13:33.82,Default_WMV_FHD_1920*1080_Microsoft YaHei,,0,0,0,,只是屁眼就要射了吧?\N主人
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.56,0:13:59.12,Default_WMV_FHD_1920*1080_Microsoft YaHei,,0,0,0,,像這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.22,0:14:03.89,Default_WMV_FHD_1920*1080_Microsoft YaHei,,0,0,0,,一起舔的話
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.36,0:14:06.82,Default_WMV_FHD_1920*1080_Microsoft YaHei,,0,0,0,,主人會更舒服\N好的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.89,0:14:17.82,Default_WMV_FHD_1920*1080_Microsoft YaHei,,0,0,0,,來做看看
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.16,0:14:39.09,Default_WMV_FHD_1920*1080_Microsoft YaHei,,0,0,0,,也請好好舔一下陰莖
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.19,0:14:42.02,Default_WMV_FHD_1920*1080_Microsoft YaHei,,0,0,0,,這樣嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.06,0:14:50.09,Default_WMV_FHD_1920*1080_Microsoft YaHei,,0,0,0,,請那樣好好含住
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.46,0:15:03.29,Default_WMV_FHD_1920*1080_Microsoft YaHei,,0,0,0,,屁眼和陰莖一起
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.66,0:15:05.86,Default_WMV_FHD_1920*1080_Microsoft YaHei,,0,0,0,,像这樣做的話很舒服吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.66,0:15:49.86,Default_WMV_FHD_1920*1080_Microsoft YaHei,,0,0,0,,舌頭全伸進去了，主人
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.96,0:16:14.79,Default_WMV_FHD_1920*1080_Microsoft YaHei,,0,0,0,,主人，很舒服嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.99,0:16:19.92,Default_WMV_FHD_1920*1080_Microsoft YaHei,,0,0,0,,還不可以射出來哦
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.82,0:16:43.02,Default_WMV_FHD_1920*1080_Microsoft YaHei,,0,0,0,,一直在發抖
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.92,0:17:06.49,Default_WMV_FHD_1920*1080_Microsoft YaHei,,0,0,0,,很爽的表情
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.12,0:17:19.69,Default_WMV_FHD_1920*1080_Microsoft YaHei,,0,0,0,,被兩個人一起舔很舒服嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.96,0:17:32.89,Default_WMV_FHD_1920*1080_Microsoft YaHei,,0,0,0,,發出很可愛的聲音哦，主人
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.69,0:17:43.89,Default_WMV_FHD_1920*1080_Microsoft YaHei,,0,0,0,,要射了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.99,0:17:47.19,Default_WMV_FHD_1920*1080_Microsoft YaHei,,0,0,0,,還不可以哦
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.92,0:17:51.96,Default_WMV_FHD_1920*1080_Microsoft YaHei,,0,0,0,,主人，不可以哦
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.96,0:17:55.99,Default_WMV_FHD_1920*1080_Microsoft YaHei,,0,0,0,,我們沒說可以之前\N不可以射出來
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.99,0:17:59.66,Default_WMV_FHD_1920*1080_Microsoft YaHei,,0,0,0,,請好好忍耐一下
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.79,0:18:40.72,Default_WMV_FHD_1920*1080_Microsoft YaHei,,0,0,0,,蛋蛋也很舒服嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.29,0:19:18.49,Default_WMV_FHD_1920*1080_Microsoft YaHei,,0,0,0,,這樣舒服嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.56,0:19:40.49,Default_WMV_FHD_1920*1080_Microsoft YaHei,,0,0,0,,陰莖都紅了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.76,0:20:14.96,Default_WMV_FHD_1920*1080_Microsoft YaHei,,0,0,0,,屁眼在發抖，主人
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.32,0:20:18.26,Default_WMV_FHD_1920*1080_Microsoft YaHei,,0,0,0,,主人，很舒服嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.82,0:20:34.02,Default_WMV_FHD_1920*1080_Microsoft YaHei,,0,0,0,,好可愛啊，主人
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.02,0:20:47.59,Default_WMV_FHD_1920*1080_Microsoft YaHei,,0,0,0,,好爽的樣子
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.29,0:22:14.49,Default_WMV_FHD_1920*1080_Microsoft YaHei,,0,0,0,,這邊也一起
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.89,0:22:22.56,Default_WMV_FHD_1920*1080_Microsoft YaHei,,0,0,0,,硬邦邦的了，主人
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.86,0:22:50.79,Default_WMV_FHD_1920*1080_Microsoft YaHei,,0,0,0,,真的好硬
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.49,0:23:33.69,Default_WMV_FHD_1920*1080_Microsoft YaHei,,0,0,0,,忍不住了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.99,0:24:15.12,Default_WMV_FHD_1920*1080_Microsoft YaHei,,0,0,0,,主人，請好好爽一下
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.09,0:24:23.92,Default_WMV_FHD_1920*1080_Microsoft YaHei,,0,0,0,,请射到我的嘴裡
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.46,0:24:35.29,Default_WMV_FHD_1920*1080_Microsoft YaHei,,0,0,0,,要射了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.66,0:24:39.69,Default_WMV_FHD_1920*1080_Microsoft YaHei,,0,0,0,,要射了嗎?\N射了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.32,0:24:53.99,Default_WMV_FHD_1920*1080_Microsoft YaHei,,0,0,0,,射了好多啊，主人
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.92,0:24:58.76,Default_WMV_FHD_1920*1080_Microsoft YaHei,,0,0,0,,这里
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.06,0:25:03.89,Default_WMV_FHD_1920*1080_Microsoft YaHei,,0,0,0,,射了好多啊
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.99,0:25:08.29,Default_WMV_FHD_1920*1080_Microsoft YaHei,,0,0,0,,幫你舔乾淨哦
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.16,0:25:28.09,Default_WMV_FHD_1920*1080_Microsoft YaHei,,0,0,0,,主人，好淫蕩的味道
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.62,0:26:13.56,Default_WMV_FHD_1920*1080_Microsoft YaHei,,0,0,0,,要這樣嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.92,0:26:16.86,Default_WMV_FHD_1920*1080_Microsoft YaHei,,0,0,0,,全舔乾净哦
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.99,0:26:35.92,Default_WMV_FHD_1920*1080_Microsoft YaHei,,0,0,0,,堆積了好多
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.79,0:26:54.62,Default_WMV_FHD_1920*1080_Microsoft YaHei,,0,0,0,,那我來這邊
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.46,0:27:44.12,Default_WMV_FHD_1920*1080_Microsoft YaHei,,0,0,0,,主人，醒了嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.32,0:27:48.16,Default_WMV_FHD_1920*1080_Microsoft YaHei,,0,0,0,,早安
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.89,0:27:52.92,Default_WMV_FHD_1920*1080_Microsoft YaHei,,0,0,0,,完全醒了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.76,0:28:07.96,Default_WMV_FHD_1920*1080_Microsoft YaHei,,0,0,0,,久等了，主人
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.32,0:28:12.72,Default_WMV_FHD_1920*1080_Microsoft YaHei,,0,0,0,,這是早餐\N這是咖啡
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.02,0:28:17.86,Default_WMV_FHD_1920*1080_Microsoft YaHei,,0,0,0,,在這之前
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.59,0:28:22.62,Default_WMV_FHD_1920*1080_Microsoft YaHei,,0,0,0,,先問個早安吧
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.46,0:28:26.29,Default_WMV_FHD_1920*1080_Microsoft YaHei,,0,0,0,,失禮了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.19,0:28:37.66,Default_WMV_FHD_1920*1080_Microsoft YaHei,,0,0,0,,請來這邊
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.36,0:28:58.56,Default_WMV_FHD_1920*1080_Microsoft YaHei,,0,0,0,,很暖和吧?主人
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.36,0:29:20.56,Default_WMV_FHD_1920*1080_Microsoft YaHei,,0,0,0,,早上開始很淫蕩的味道嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.92,0:29:23.49,Default_WMV_FHD_1920*1080_Microsoft YaHei,,0,0,0,,很淫蕩的味道
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.42,0:29:39.62,Default_WMV_FHD_1920*1080_Microsoft YaHei,,0,0,0,,那麼直接的
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.62,0:29:42.92,Default_WMV_FHD_1920*1080_Microsoft YaHei,,0,0,0,,失禮了，失禮了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.79,0:29:50.62,Default_WMV_FHD_1920*1080_Microsoft YaHei,,0,0,0,,我們一起幫你舔哦
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.99,0:29:53.19,Default_WMV_FHD_1920*1080_Microsoft YaHei,,0,0,0,,失禮了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.92,0:30:07.86,Default_WMV_FHD_1920*1080_Microsoft YaHei,,0,0,0,,早上開始，屁眼就開始發抖了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.06,0:30:23.62,Default_WMV_FHD_1920*1080_Microsoft YaHei,,0,0,0,,不要遮掩，請好好動一下
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.92,0:30:41.22,Default_WMV_FHD_1920*1080_Microsoft YaHei,,0,0,0,,一直在發抖
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.59,0:30:46.72,Default_WMV_FHD_1920*1080_Microsoft YaHei,,0,0,0,,早上開始好有精神啊
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.82,0:30:50.39,Default_WMV_FHD_1920*1080_Microsoft YaHei,,0,0,0,,但是很健康
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.46,0:31:11.66,Default_WMV_FHD_1920*1080_Microsoft YaHei,,0,0,0,,舌頭都伸進去了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.36,0:31:22.29,Default_WMV_FHD_1920*1080_Microsoft YaHei,,0,0,0,,吾歡舔屁眼嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.66,0:31:26.69,Default_WMV_FHD_1920*1080_Microsoft YaHei,,0,0,0,,很喜歡\N好好摸一下
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.12,0:31:37.69,Default_WMV_FHD_1920*1080_Microsoft YaHei,,0,0,0,,好爽的樣子
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.76,0:32:32.32,Default_WMV_FHD_1920*1080_Microsoft YaHei,,0,0,0,,我也失禮了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.19,0:32:41.86,Default_WMV_FHD_1920*1080_Microsoft YaHei,,0,0,0,,早上開始，真的好有精神
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.92,0:32:52.49,Default_WMV_FHD_1920*1080_Microsoft YaHei,,0,0,0,,失禮了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.56,0:34:09.12,Default_WMV_FHD_1920*1080_Microsoft YaHei,,0,0,0,,幫他好好舔一下
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.39,0:34:23.42,Default_WMV_FHD_1920*1080_Microsoft YaHei,,0,0,0,,是的，好好吮吸的話\N陰莖會很有精神的
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.62,0:36:29.56,Default_WMV_FHD_1920*1080_Microsoft YaHei,,0,0,0,,全都舔乾淨哦
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.42,0:37:43.62,Default_WMV_FHD_1920*1080_Microsoft YaHei,,0,0,0,,舒服嗎?主人
